stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Active : paid order claimed at registration,<br/>or athlete registration link used
  Active --> Revoked : athlete withdrawn<br/>from the roster
  Revoked --> Active : athlete reinstated<br/>with a written reason
  Active --> TermOver : academic term ends
  Active --> [*] : account deleted
  Revoked --> [*] : account deleted
  TermOver --> [*] : account deleted

  state "Active, term running<br/>Check In and Gym ID allowed" as Active
  state "Revoked<br/>Check In refused" as Revoked
  state "Active, term over<br/>no longer current" as TermOver

  note right of Active
    Check In also needs a photo on file,
    not marked as pending by Staff
  end note
